# Keep shell scripts LF and executable. A CRLF shebang breaks `#!/usr/bin/env bash`
# on Linux runners, and a lost +x bit breaks `./script.sh` - both have bitten this
# project once, so they are pinned here.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.dart text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
